{
 "id": "922d5d49-c692-4c29-a247-bbfd07268c7f",
 "page_id": "cc85e207-5bf6-4a3d-acdb-c94769296073",
 "language": "br",
 "title": "Sobre Gabriel Mangabeira | Atleta Olímpico e Estrategista de Growth Marketing",
 "meta_description": "Da piscina olímpica ao crescimento digital. Gabriel une IA, Web3 e dados para criar sistemas de marketing mensuráveis e escaláveis.",
 "content": "<article class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 md:py-12\">\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <header class=\"mb-12 text-center\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Sobre Mim</h1>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground\">Da disciplina olímpica à estratégia de crescimento Web3 — descubra como Gabriel Mangabeira combina IA, dados e storytelling para ajudar marcas a crescer com precisão e foco.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- From Olympic Lanes to Digital Growth -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Das Raias Olímpicas ao Crescimento Digital</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Antes de construir um sistema de marketing, aprendi o que consistência realmente significa — dentro de uma piscina de 25 metros.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Representar o <strong>Brasil nas Olimpíadas</strong> me ensinou que os menores hábitos diários criam as maiores vitórias a longo prazo.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          Essa mesma filosofia impulsiona tudo o que faço hoje — ajudando equipes e fundadores a crescer através de sistemas que combinam <strong>disciplina, dados e criatividade</strong>.\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n          De <strong>exchanges Web3</strong> a <strong>marcas SaaS impulsionadas por IA</strong>, liderei estratégias que atraem milhões de usuários e transformam visibilidade em crescimento sustentável.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"/images/gabriel-swimming-action.png\" alt=\"Gabriel Mangabeira competindo nas Olimpíadas\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- The Turning Point -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">O Ponto de Virada</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Não troquei uma arena por outra da noite para o dia.</p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Houve um momento — entre treinos e dashboards de campanhas — onde percebi que crescimento, como desempenho, é previsível quando você o trata como um sistema.\n    </p>\n    <blockquote class=\"my-6 rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6 italic\">\n      \"A natação me ensinou como superar limites; o marketing me ensinou como medi-los.\"\n    </blockquote>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Foi quando comecei a desenhar frameworks para crescimento repetível e mensurável.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- My Journey -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Minha Jornada</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 space-y-6\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2008</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Jogos Olímpicos</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Consistência supera intensidade.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2015</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Neil Patel Brasil</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">SEO é estratégia, não atalhos.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2019</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Binance LATAM</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Escala amplifica clareza e caos — gerencie ambos.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"p-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold text-primary\">2023</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Construindo frameworks Web3</h3>\n              <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Liberdade vem de sistemas que pensam por você.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Behind the Frameworks -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Por Trás dos Frameworks</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Não estou apenas construindo funis — estou construindo <strong>fundações</strong>.\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">\n      Todo sistema de cliente segue um ritmo: → <strong>Observar</strong> → <strong>Experimentar</strong> → <strong>Medir</strong> → <strong>Escalar</strong>\n    </p>\n    <h3 class=\"mt-8 text-xl font-semibold\">Valores Fundamentais</h3>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"/></svg>\n            Disciplina\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Mantenha a raia, confie no processo.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\"/><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2\"/><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"22\"/></svg>\n            Curiosidade\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Sempre questione o óbvio.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"/><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"/></svg>\n            Consistência\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Dados sobre drama.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-primary\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>\n            Transparência\n          </h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Crescimento sem suposições.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- In My Own Words -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Nas Minhas Próprias Palavras</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border\">\n        <img src=\"/images/gabriel-professional-about.png\" alt=\"Retrato profissional de Gabriel Mangabeira\" class=\"h-auto w-full object-cover\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </div>\n      <blockquote class=\"rounded-md border-l-4 border-primary bg-muted/40 p-6\">\n        <p class=\"italic\">Crescimento não é trabalhar mais duro; é desenhar sistemas que fazem o trabalho duro por você.</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-4 italic\">Toda campanha que construo é testável, repetível e escalável — impulsionada por IA, alimentada por dados e conduzida pela criatividade humana.</p>\n      </blockquote>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- What I'm Building -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">O Que Estou Construindo</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Ferramentas nascidas de resolver problemas reais:</p>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Web3 ROAST</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Auditorias CRO para projetos crypto.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Token Health Scan</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Avaliação de riscos para ecossistemas blockchain.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight\">Growth Experiments Framework</h3>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 pt-0\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">O sistema operacional por trás do meu trabalho com clientes.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mt-6 text-muted-foreground\">Cada um começou como um experimento pessoal — agora impulsionam resultados para outros.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Beyond Work -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Além do Trabalho</h2>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Quando não estou construindo sistemas de crescimento, geralmente estou:</p>\n    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\">\n      <li>🏊‍♂️ Mergulhando em apneia ou nadando em águas abertas</li>\n      <li>✍️ Escrevendo frameworks no Medium</li>\n      <li>🤝 Mentorando fundadores e criadores Web3</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Porque sistemas não matam a criatividade — eles a sustentam.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Let's Collaborate -->\n  <section class=\"mb-12\">\n    <div class=\"rounded-lg border-2 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-6 text-center md:p-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"mt-0 text-2xl font-semibold\">Vamos Colaborar</h2>\n      <blockquote class=\"my-4 text-lg italic text-muted-foreground\">Pronto para transformar seu marketing em um sistema de crescimento mensurável?</blockquote>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"/#how-i-help\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2\">Trabalhe Comigo</a>\n        <a href=\"https://calendly.com/gabriel-mangabeira/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2\">Agende uma Conversa</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Follow My Work -->\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Acompanhe Meu Trabalho</h2>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mangabeira/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        LinkedIn <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://medium.com/@gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Medium <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/gmangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        GitHub <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriel_Mangabeira\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center text-primary hover:underline\">\n        Wikipedia <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"ml-1 h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</article>",
